{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"强化学习基础理论","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/reinforcement-learning-applied/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"mdp-policy-gradient","title":"马尔可夫决策过程与策略梯度","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/reinforcement-learning-applied/foundations/mdp-policy-gradient","wordCount":1471,"readingTime":6},{"seq":2,"slug":"value-based-methods","title":"基于价值的方法与时序差分","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/reinforcement-learning-applied/foundations/value-based-methods","wordCount":1459,"readingTime":6},{"seq":3,"slug":"reward-engineering","title":"奖励工程与信号设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/reinforcement-learning-applied/foundations/reward-engineering","wordCount":1611,"readingTime":7}],"introMarkdown":"# 强化学习基础理论\n\n本章建立强化学习工程应用所需的理论基础。与教科书式的全面覆盖不同，这里聚焦于直接支撑后续工程实践的三个核心支柱：马尔可夫决策过程与策略梯度方法（现代 RLHF/DPO 的数学基础）、基于价值的方法（Offline RL 与工业推荐的理论根基）、以及奖励工程（将业务目标转化为可优化信号的系统方法论）。\n\n每篇文档都从工程应用的角度切入理论，确保读者在进入后续章节时，能够理解算法设计背后的动机与约束。\n"}